# GitHub labels a repository with the language that has the most code.
# Python is the main version of this package; the MATLAB version in
# matlab/ is a companion. The lines below keep the MATLAB tests and
# examples out of GitHub's language count, so the label is Python.
# The MATLAB library code is still counted, so MATLAB still appears
# in the repository's language bar.
matlab/tests/** -linguist-detectable
matlab/examples/** -linguist-detectable
